            "review_title": "Review at Guru Natural Specialty Coffee",
            "review_text": "Vishal\n12 contributions\n1\nSuperb host & superb drinks\nAug 2019 • Couples\nThis place is located above a general shop and accessible by the stairs on the side so it is a little hidden. However it is spectacular. \n\nMy partner loves coffee but found everywhere seemed to either burn or over brew leaving it tasting bitter. Her eyes lit up as she tasted what the owner recommended saying it was one of the best coffees she has ever had.\n\nI personally absolutely hate coffee and prefer tea, but the owner had a perfect suggestion for me too. He gace me a brew made from the fruit of a coffee plant and it tasted delicious. \n\nThe owner is extremely passionate about what he does and is incredibly knowledgeable. He showed us all his many types of filters (one which takes 2 days) and gave us lots of other brews to try and taught us about different fermenting processes.\n\nI can guarantee everyone will love this place.\nRead more\nWritten August 11, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-03",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
