            "review_title": "Review at Guru Natural Specialty Coffee",
            "review_text": "Liubava Orlova\n1 contribution\n0\nA must-visit for coffee lovers in Nha Trang!\nMay 2019 • Couples\nThis small coffee shop offers an unique choice of speciality Vietnamese coffee. Besides several sorts of excellent coffee, they have every kind of brewing devices and techniques for you to enjoy. Located in the main tourist area of Nha Trang, this place is very quiet, air-conditioned and beautifully decorated, a wonderful chance to get refreshed and meet the most amazing coffee-makers of Vietnam.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 23, 2019",
